+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+Certificate verification is enabled on all builds, development builds included. Testing that needs a certificate uses self-signed certificates rather than turning verification off. Connections use HTTPS everywhere, with no plaintext exception, since proper certificate management is now in place.
